# PyCharm
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
.idea/

passwords.json
# Author's working documents, not repository documentation.
#
# These live in the working tree because they are written and read here, but they are
# not part of the project: agentic-rag-informe.html is the technical proposal the
# CRAG/Self-RAG work was derived from (its k=2 / Mistral 7B diagram is a deliberate
# "v1.0" panel, not a stale copy of the current architecture), and the URUCON 2026
# files are unpublished conference drafts. The repository is public.
#
# Note this list does NOT cover resources/files/*.pdf. Thirteen of the fifteen course
# documents the pipeline actually loads are untracked, so the corpus every measurement
# was taken against cannot be reproduced from this repository. Publishing them is a
# rights decision for the cátedra, not a housekeeping one — they are left visible in
# git status on purpose, so the gap stays a pending decision instead of a hidden one.
agentic-rag-informe.html
Trabajo URUCON*
Sistema automático de consultas*

# Agent tooling state (skill registry), not project source.
.atl/
